  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 727a75301c3d24613a3ebcec4a24c2c8, type: 3}
  title: MOVIN Unity Plugin V3
  sections:
  - heading: Overview
    text: Unity sample project and import package for receiving MOVIN/VMC motion capture streams over OSC/UDP.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Quick Start
    text: Open Assets/MOVIN/Scenes/Sample_MOVINman.unity, enter Play mode, and stream VMC Protocol OSC data to UDP port 11235.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Included Samples
    text: Sample_MOVINman uses Assets/MOVIN/Character/MOVINman/MOVINman_V3.fbx. Sample_Ch14 and Sample_Ch29 provide additional Mixamo character setups.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Receiver Components
    text: VMCReceiver listens for OSC/VMC messages. MOVIN.Core.MocapReceiver applies streamed root and bone poses to a character hierarchy. VMCReceiverMonitorUI shows packet, frame, drop, latency, and validation status at runtime.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Validation Logs
    text: Validation logs default to Documents/MOVIN Studio/StreamValidation/Unity unless Validation Log Directory is set on the receiver.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: VMC Protocol
    text:
    linkText: Read the VMC Protocol reference
    url: https://protocol.vmc.info/english.html
  loadedLayout: 1
